# Per-machine TLS material. The CA private key must never be committed or
# shipped — see docs/04-certificates-and-browser-trust.md.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash. Unanchored, "certs/" matches a directory of
# that name at *any* depth, which silently excluded internal/certs/ — the
# package was on disk and building locally while absent from the repository.
/certs/

# Build output
/bin/
/dist/

# Vendor SDK: 3DxWare_SDK_v4-0-6_r22071. Not redistributed here — download it
# from 3dconnexion.com and unpack it at the repo root. Only the test harness
# needs it (web/testpage loads 3DconnexionJS from it); the bridge itself does
# not depend on it at build or run time.
/3DxWare_SDK_v4-0-6_r22071/
/3DxWare_SDK_v4-0-6_r22071.zip
